  message: "Merged in PR #1606 (ee7dcb505c). hypergumbo_core/confidence_sites.py (logic, 100% covered) + scripts/check-confidence-sites (thin CLI: gate / --list / --update-baseline, which refuses to add entries) + .ci/confidence-sites-baseline.json (empty). Findings: literal_out_of_band (analyzer band, or linker range for hypergumbo_core/linkers/) and computed_uncommented (variable, expression or conditional on a seeded pathway without the caller-valued marker in the call or the comment block above it). Gate: tests/test_confidence_sites.py::test_live_tree_matches_baseline (new or stale entries fail). Red check: the same scan over bab7eed514 reports 123 findings (111 computed, 12 literal). smart-test unions the gate test into any change touching packages/*/src (the import slice never selects it). NOT done: a .githooks pre-commit entry (governance file, needs owner approval)."  # 94d3
